{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"10th\n個人PVの予告編がアップされました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46　『中田花奈-予告編-』: http://youtu.be/Nvwhj02GyIU"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中島望さんに撮っていただきました`・ω・´"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ予告編なので\n続きは発売されるまで待っててね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/10/01/2683042/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"海岸で撮ったんだけど\n撮影の合間は海辺を楽しんでたよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"発売されたらオフショット載せますね～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/10/01/2683042/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、また10thのお話"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スペシャルプレゼントのイベント"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回はお茶会だったけど\n今回はスペシャルライブと似顔絵会やります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スペシャルライブは大阪と名古屋"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"似顔絵会は東京大阪名古屋"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"であります"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ただ、\n名古屋チームと大阪チームで\n参加メンバーが変わるので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田がどっちに参加するかは\nまだ決まってないので\n発表されたら確認して応募してね＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"東京の似顔絵会に参加するのは\n決まってるよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/10/01/2683042/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"地方での似顔絵会は初めてだ～！"},{"type":"